REQUIREMENTS IN FORCE:
- item: UHT milk, quantity 1; requirements: kind: ready-to-drink; origin: Australia
- budget: at most 390 cents in total
- pick: any listing that fits everything
- in stock only
- rule from the request: Send no more than 3 messages.
- rule from the request: Use no more than 38 moves.
- rule from the request: Make no extra switchbacks.
- rule from the request: Do not suggest substitutes if nothing fits.
- rule from the request: Say so plainly if nothing fits.
- if nothing fits: end without naming or suggesting any listing
- listing attributes come from datasheet_for_item; a listing's page (what a chain of pages or a page check means) is shown by view_listing

